sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Owner as Human / GPUI (Plane 0)
    participant Kernel as Rust Kernel (Plane 1)
    participant Policy as Rights & Embargo Engine
    participant CAS as Encrypted CAS / Custody Vault
    participant Supervisor as Trusted Worker Supervisor
    participant LLM as Offline LLM Container (Boundary X)
    participant Runner as Trusted Oracle + Runner (Plane 2)
    Owner->>Kernel: Signed campaign config
    Kernel->>Policy: Authorize source and local context
    Policy-->>Kernel: Permit/deny + policy digest
    Kernel->>CAS: Reserve qualified destination storage
    CAS-->>Kernel: Fresh capacity / fenced lease
    Kernel->>Supervisor: Stage approved snapshot + task
    Supervisor->>LLM: Read-only Rust source + offline tools
    LLM-->>Supervisor: Patch + experiment proposal (untrusted)
    Supervisor-->>LLM: Opaque submission_received
    Supervisor->>Kernel: Signed ingestion receipt (no verdict)
    Kernel->>Policy: Validate patch scope, rights, conflicts
    Kernel->>Runner: Frozen build + oracle + exclusive benchmark
    Runner-->>Kernel: Signed samples and verification verdict
    Kernel->>CAS: Seal raw results, metadata and correspondence
    Kernel->>Policy: Compile private feedback release view
    Policy-->>Kernel: Approved projection digest
    Kernel->>Supervisor: Optional next private feedback capsule
    Note over Kernel,CAS: Privileged truth, audit and signatures never enter offline worker
